# MERCATOR, planet: through the ring, down to the site, out on foot, back aboard and up.
# Run: pocketme-sim --boot off --fps 60 --frames 6600 --script mercator-planet.script
# (from boards/desktop). MERCATOR's starting settings (2026-11-23): 60 pictures a second,
# the CHASE view and DETAIL HIGH; the scene plays at those and changes no setting.

# Home screen: seven steps right, from BENCH to MERCATOR, then start it.
5 press right
6 release right
8 press right
9 release right
11 press right
12 release right
14 press right
15 release right
17 press right
18 release right
20 press right
21 release right
23 press right
24 release right
32 press south
33 release south

100 press south          # PLAY: docked at JAKEL
101 release south
200 press south          # LAUNCH
201 release south

# Space: turn towards the planet's site ring and dive through it nose down.
240 press left
318 release left
320 press west           # faster, to top speed
900 release west
920 press left
960 release left
1800 press left
1870 release left
1880 press left
1888 release left
1888 press up            # nose down at the ring
1896 release up
1900 press right
1907 release right
# About 2722: through the ring, the entry starts (3 s). The clip mercator-entry
# is 2650-3000: the ring's lights and the SITE beacon just above the ship, the
# entry, then the hover (HOLD) from about 2940.

# Below: hold the height, fly over the pad, then sink onto it.
2935 touch 290 225       # tap on the JETS box: HOLD
2938 lift
2940 press up            # forward, towards the pad
3840 release up
4140 touch 290 225       # tap on JETS again: SINK; the pad comes into view below
4143 lift
# About 5210: LANDED. The hatch opens and the pilot is out on foot from about 5265.
# The clip mercator-landing is 4980-5320.

# On foot: turn the camera, walk out, look back, walk back to the ship.
5320 press l             # L taps: the camera turns 45 degrees each
5324 release l
5340 press l
5344 release l
5360 press l
5364 release l
5380 press l
5384 release l
5400 press l
5404 release l
5460 press up            # walk out (the wreck's smoke on the horizon)
5900 release up
5920 press l
5924 release l
5940 press l
5944 release l
5960 press l
5964 release l
5980 press l             # the ship ahead
5984 release l
6020 press up            # walk back to the hatch; frames 6030-6350 are the clip
6460 release up
6500 press east          # B held 0.5 s at the hatch: board and lift off
6580 release east
# About 6555: LIFT OFF, before the day's summary card.
